<title>EU: EC REPORT WEEKLY DIARY FOR MONDAY, DEC 30-SUNDAY, JAN 5.</title>
<headline>EC REPORT WEEKLY DIARY FOR MONDAY, DEC 30-SUNDAY, JAN 5.</headline>
<text>
<p>TUESDAY, DECEMBER 31</p>
